      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "refactor(ui): remove dead exports",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe shrink-only dead-export ratchet still carried 364 `ui/` entries, allowing unused Control UI exports to remain indefinitely.\n\nCloses #105791\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Internalize unused Control UI symbols, deleting helpers and tests that existed only for those exports.\n- Keep meaningful behavior coverage through production-owned modules and public component boundaries.\n- Split custom-element registration side effects where production consumers need the implementation export.\n- Preserve the rebased Workboard module split while shrinking its public barrel and localizing its mutation helper.\n- Regenerate the dead-export baseline with no remaining entries whose path starts with `ui/`.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended user-visible behavior change. The Control UI exposes a smaller internal module surface while retaining gateway reconnect, stale-chunk recovery, component registration, chat, workspace, Workboard, and navigation behavior.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- `pnpm deadcode:exports:update` followed by `pnpm deadcode:exports` — 4,520 entries matched on final head ([Crabbox run](https://crabbox.openclaw.ai/portal/runs/run_552511f39755))\n- `pnpm check:loc`\n- Focused Workboard/chat tests — 3 files, 290 tests passed ([Crabbox run](https://crabbox.openclaw.ai/portal/runs/run_3bd97159da4f))\n- `pnpm tsgo:ui`\n- `pnpm tsgo:test:ui`\n- `pnpm test:ui` — 238 files, 3,456 tests passed on the preceding rebased head\n- `pnpm build`\n- `pnpm check:changed`\n- Hosted CI fully green on the preceding rebased head ([run 29227357872](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/29227357872))\n- `git diff --check`\n- Fresh final-head autoreview: no accepted/actionable findings\n",
